<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine gov't to announce wheat farmer aid.</title>
<headline>Argentine gov't to announce wheat farmer aid.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Agriculture Secretary Felipe Sola will announce measures to aid wheat farmers whose crops were damaged by last week's storms in a news conference Thursday, Sola's office announced Wednesday.</p>
<p>The government estimates that some 200,000 hectares of wheat were lost and the storms damaged the quality of another 700,000 to 1.0 million tonnes.</p>
<p>((-- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
